import{_ as i,o as a,c as t,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 240 | Realm and Culture: The Realm Dimension of Myriad Races Cultural Fusion","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 240 | Realm and Culture: The Realm Dimension of Myriad Races Cultural Fusion","no":240,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Culture","Myriad Races Fusion","Civilization"],"related":["05-Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program","50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview","52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0240_模块1-境界与文化-万族文明交融的境界维度.md","filePath":"en/0240_模块1-境界与文化-万族文明交融的境界维度.md"}'),n={name:"en/0240_模块1-境界与文化-万族文明交融的境界维度.md"};function l(o,e,s,u,c,d){return a(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<h1 id="entry-240-realm-and-culture-the-realm-dimension-of-myriad-races-cultural-fusion" tabindex="-1">Entry 240 | Realm and Culture: The Realm Dimension of Myriad Races Cultural Fusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-240-realm-and-culture-the-realm-dimension-of-myriad-races-cultural-fusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 240 | Realm and Culture: The Realm Dimension of Myriad Races Cultural Fusion&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 05, 50, 52</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-higher-the-cultivation-the-broader-the-culture" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The higher the cultivation, the broader the culture <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-higher-the-cultivation-the-broader-the-culture" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The higher the cultivation, the broader the culture&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In Heng Yuan Zhou (Wanling Hengmao Origin Cosmos)&#39;s civilization ecology, Myriad Races each have their own cultural traditions — carbon-based material races&#39; civilization, energy condensation races&#39; civilization, mechanical construction races&#39; civilization, consciousness information races&#39; civilization, hybrid variation races&#39; civilization. Realm is not only a yardstick of power, but also a yardstick of cultural vision — <strong>the higher a cultivator&#39;s realm, the stronger their cultural inclusiveness, the deeper the cultural fusion</strong>.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are directly embodied in the relationship between realm and culture: the anti-predation axiom negates cultural predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races is cultural equality&#39;s foundation; the collective ascension axiom guides cultural fusion to serve civilization ascension; the causal self-discipline axiom constrains cultural influence not to be crudely implanted; the law-first axiom ensures cultural fusion&#39;s law framework is stable; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>This entry analyzes how realm advancement drives Myriad Races cultural fusion.</p><h2 id="i-cultural-fusion-s-realm-tiers" tabindex="-1">I. Cultural Fusion&#39;s Realm Tiers <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-cultural-fusion-s-realm-tiers" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Cultural Fusion&#39;s Realm Tiers&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Realm</th><th>Cultural Vision</th><th>Fusion Mode</th><th>Typical Manifestation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sense - Condensed Origin</td><td>Home race culture dominant</td><td>Contact and understanding</td><td>Knowing other races&#39; cultural knowledge</td></tr><tr><td>Transform - Law Origin</td><td>Cross-cultural learning</td><td>Skill exchange</td><td>Learning other races&#39; cultivation methods</td></tr><tr><td>Dao - Dao Integration</td><td>Cultural fusion</td><td>Dao-rules mutual reference</td><td>Personal Dao fusing multi-race elements</td></tr><tr><td>Boundary-Breaking - World-Creation</td><td>Cross-plane culture</td><td>Civilization bridge</td><td>Inter-plane cultural exchange</td></tr><tr><td>Origin Realm</td><td>Cosmic culture</td><td>Civilization design</td><td>Guiding Myriad Races civilization&#39;s common evolution</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-five-mortal-cultivation-realms-cultural-fusion" tabindex="-1">II. Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms&#39; Cultural Fusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-five-mortal-cultivation-realms-cultural-fusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Five Mortal-Cultivation Realms&#39; Cultural Fusion&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_2-1-sense-condensed-origin-cultural-enlightenment" tabindex="-1">2.1 Sense - Condensed Origin: Cultural Enlightenment <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-1-sense-condensed-origin-cultural-enlightenment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.1 Sense - Condensed Origin: Cultural Enlightenment&quot;">​</a></h3><p>This stage cultivators have just begun contacting the cultivation world; cultural vision is mainly within home-race culture. But basic education already includes Myriad Races cultural common sense — knowing the cosmos has not only one&#39;s own race, but also five genealogy Myriad Races life.</p><p>This stage&#39;s cultural fusion is &quot;knowing it exists&quot; — knowing other races&#39; existence, understanding basic cultural differences, cultivating basic cultural respect.</p><h3 id="_2-2-transform-law-origin-cross-cultural-learning" tabindex="-1">2.2 Transform - Law Origin: Cross-Cultural Learning <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-2-transform-law-origin-cross-cultural-learning" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.2 Transform - Law Origin: Cross-Cultural Learning&quot;">​</a></h3><p>This stage cultivators begin hitting bottlenecks in cultivation, needing to learn from other races&#39; cultivation methods. Cultural fusion upgrades from &quot;knowing&quot; to &quot;learning&quot;:</p><ul><li>Energy condensation races learn carbon-based life&#39;s life cycle theory</li><li>Consciousness information races learn mechanical construction races&#39; precise operation</li><li>Each race exchanges cultivation insights on the Alaya Network</li></ul><p>This cross-cultural learning is bidirectional — you learn mine, I learn yours, mutually enriching.</p><h3 id="_2-3-dao-origin-dao-rules-mutual-reference" tabindex="-1">2.3 Dao Origin: Dao-Rules Mutual Reference <a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-3-dao-origin-dao-rules-mutual-reference" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;2.3 Dao Origin: Dao-Rules Mutual Reference&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Dao Origin cultivators when distilling personal Dao-rules begin consciously drawing inspiration from multi-race cultures:</p><ul><li>Human cultivators from plant spirits&#39; growth rhythm attain &quot;Dao follows nature&quot;</li><li>Energy life from mechanical races&#39; precise logic attain &quot;the order of laws&quot;</li><li>Each race&#39;s Dao-rules mutually inspire and enrich</li></ul><p>This stage&#39;s cultural fusion has already deepened to the &quot;Dao&quot; level — not surface cultural exchange, but worldview and philosophy-level mutual reference.</p><h2 id="iii-four-sacred-cultivation-realms-cultural-fusion" tabindex="-1">III. Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms&#39; Cultural Fusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-four-sacred-cultivation-realms-cultural-fusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Four Sacred-Cultivation Realms&#39; Cultural Fusion&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_3-1-dao-integration-the-depth-of-cultural-fusion" tabindex="-1">3.1 Dao Integration: The Depth of Cultural Fusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-1-dao-integration-the-depth-of-cultural-fusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.1 Dao Integration: The Depth of Cultural Fusion&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Dao Integration cultivators&#39; personal Dao fuses with cosmic laws; their cultural vision expands to the entire cultivation region. This stage&#39;s cultural fusion manifests as:</p><ul><li>Personal Dao-rules fused with multi-race cultural elements</li><li>As grandmasters guiding disciples of other races, cultural understanding deepens</li><li>Participating in cross-race law seminars, promoting cultural-level consensus</li></ul><h3 id="_3-2-boundary-breaking-world-creation-cross-plane-cultural-bridges" tabindex="-1">3.2 Boundary-Breaking - World-Creation: Cross-Plane Cultural Bridges <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-2-boundary-breaking-world-creation-cross-plane-cultural-bridges" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.2 Boundary-Breaking - World-Creation: Cross-Plane Cultural Bridges&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Boundary-Breaking and World-Creation cultivators traverse different planes, becoming cultural bridges between planes:</p><ul><li>Bringing one plane&#39;s culture back to another plane</li><li>Designing multicultural coexistence environments in self-created small worlds</li><li>Promoting peaceful exchange between different plane civilizations</li></ul><p>This stage&#39;s cultural fusion has already transcended the racial level, entering the civilization level.</p><h3 id="_3-3-origin-realm-cosmic-level-cultural-design" tabindex="-1">3.3 Origin Realm: Cosmic-Level Cultural Design <a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-3-origin-realm-cosmic-level-cultural-design" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;3.3 Origin Realm: Cosmic-Level Cultural Design&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Origin Realm strong ones participate in cosmic civilization direction planning; their cultural vision is cosmic-level:</p><ul><li>Designing a framework for Myriad Races cultures&#39; common development</li><li>Coordinating cultural relations among different cosmic civilizations</li><li>Guiding Myriad Races cultures toward symbiosis while preserving diversity</li></ul><h2 id="iv-cultural-fusion-principles" tabindex="-1">IV. Cultural Fusion Principles <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-cultural-fusion-principles" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Cultural Fusion Principles&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad Races civilization fusion follows these principles:</p><ul><li><strong>Cultural equality</strong>: no &quot;advanced culture&quot; vs. &quot;inferior culture&quot; distinction</li><li><strong>Tradition respect</strong>: no forced cultural assimilation, each race&#39;s cultural traditions respected</li><li><strong>Bidirectional exchange</strong>: cultural fusion is bidirectional, not one-way cultural output</li><li><strong>Autonomous choice</strong>: each race autonomously chooses which foreign cultural elements to absorb</li><li><strong>Diversity protection</strong>: cultural fusion does not equal cultural unification; diversity itself is wealth</li></ul><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cultural fusion avoids the repeated waste of each culture independently groping — one race&#39;s cultural breakthrough can inspire Myriad Races</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cultural fusion opposes cultural predation — no forced assimilation, no cultural colonialism</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo systems&#39; culture is a single imperial culture; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s culture is Myriad Races multi-race fusion</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: cultural fusion fully covers all five Myriad Races genealogies</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cultural fusion expands with cosmos expansion, cross-cosmic cultural exchange has corresponding mechanisms</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The relationship between realm and culture is not &quot;the stronger the more only home-race culture,&quot; but &quot;the stronger the more understanding of Myriad Races culture.&quot; A cultivator&#39;s cultural inclusiveness grows synchronously with realm — starting from home-race culture, through cross-cultural learning, ultimately reaching the vision of Myriad Races cultural symbiosis. This is the republican axiom of Myriad Races in culture&#39;s concrete realization.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./05-万族共进基本纲领.html">05-Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program</a> · <a href="./50-万族谱系总览.html">50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview</a> · <a href="./52-异族分类与共生.html">52-Alien Classification and Symbiosis</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',40)])])}const g=i(n,[["render",l]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
